{"id": 8503335256262, "title": "1080p Full HD Camera for Video Baby Monitor BM04", "body_html": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Type</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1\">The <b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">momcozy baby monitor bm04</b> is a high-performance <b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">momcozy 5 inch dual mode smart baby monitor with 2 camera</b> system. Featuring a premium <b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"138\">1080P camera</b>, it serves as an advanced <b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"177\">video baby monitor</b> that bridges the gap between private local viewing and convenient remote monitoring.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Selling Points</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1\">As a top-tier <b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">momcozy dual baby monitor</b>, it allows you to choose between a secure 2.4GHz local connection via the parent unit or a <b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"131\">WiFi baby monitor</b> feed via the app when you are on the go. This <b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"195\">baby monitor with camera</b> features intelligent AI motion detection that alerts you to risks like a covered face or face-down sleeping, alongside Danger Zone alerts. It supports continuous or motion-activated auto-recording to capture memories, which can be shared with up to 20 family members. Its powerful infrared <b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"510\">night vision</b> provides sufficient lighting to see your baby's face clearly in the dark when placed within 5 meters of the crib.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material &amp; Touch</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,1\">The camera and monitor housings are crafted from premium, matte ABS material with a skin-like finish that resists scratches and fingerprints. The parent unit is equipped with soft-touch silicone buttons designed for completely silent operation during late-night checks.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Target Audience / Use Case</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,3,1\">Perfect for tech-savvy parents, multi-child families requiring dual-room viewings, and working parents who want to stay securely connected with their little ones through a smart app.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Size &amp; Compatibility</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,4,1\">Features a brilliant 5-inch parent display paired with two 1080P HD cameras. Ensure the camera is mounted at least 0.6m (24 inches) above the crib for optimal focal length, and within 5m (16 feet) horizontally for the best night vision performance.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Care Instructions</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,5,1\">Disconnect from power before cleaning. Wipe gently with a dry, lint-free microfiber cloth. Do not use chemical solvents or abrasive cleaners on the screen or camera lenses.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>", "vendor": "Momcozy", "product_type": "Baby Monitor", "created_at": "2025-04-30T04:56:27-04:00", "handle": "camera-for-video-baby-monitor-bm04", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:59-04:00", "published_at": "2026-05-21T04:56:59-04:00", "template_suffix": "bm04", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "baby care, baby monitor, baby safety, baby watch, best baby monitor, Top100_Sales, 婴幼儿", "variants": [{"id": 45866579591366, "product_id": 8503335256262, "title": "Default Title", "price": "89.99", "sku": "ME005-WH10NB-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "89.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_ma